# Wikimedia refuses most Commons previews unless the request says how to reach
# whoever is running the tool. Measured 2026-08-22: 8 of 8 previews came back
# with a contact in the header, 4 of 8 without, at the same speed.
#
# Rename this file to contact.txt and put ONE line in it — an email address or
# a URL. It is sent to Wikimedia in the request header on every call, and to
# wallhaven too. Nothing else sees it, and it is never written into any file
# this program saves.
#
# contact.txt is in .gitignore, so it will not be committed.
#
# Example:
# someone@example.com
